Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), systemd
Description: SnippetHub - private snippet and note vault
 A private knowledge vault for code snippets, tutorials and notes.
 Markdown with syntax highlighting, folders and tags, attachments,
 light/dark themes, whole-vault backup and import. All data stays
 on your own NAS.
